====== PHICOMM K2P/KE2P======

The PHICOMM [[http://www.phicomm.com/cn/en.php/News/detail/cateid/2/id/435.html|K2P]]/[[https://www.phicomm.de/en/product/smart-home-products/smart-wlan-routers/ke2p|KE2P]] (also [[https://www.phicomm.de/wp-content/uploads/Phicomm-KE2P-Tech.-Details.pdf |KE 2P]]) is an AC1300 dual-band Gigabit indoor wireless router. It is based on the MediaTek MT7621A SoC, and features 5x 10/100/1000 Mbps switched Ethernet ports (4x LAN, 1x WAN) and MT7615E-based 802.11a/b/g/n/ac WiFi.

{{:media:phicomm:phicomm_ke2p_box.jpg?250|Phicomm KE2P box}} {{:media:phicomm:phicomm_ke2p_inbox.jpg?250|Phicomm KE2P inside the box}} {{:media:phicomm:phicomm_ke2p_top.jpg?250|Phicomm KE2P top view}} {{:media:phicomm:phicomm_ke2p_bottom.jpg?250|Phicomm KE2P bottom view}} {{:media:phicomm:phicomm_ke2p_back.jpg?250|Phicomm KE2P back view}}

